{"text": "Ironworks Yard - Unit B - CONFIDENTIAL\n\nLEASE ABSTRACT\nPrepared 10 March 2026 by Delphine Castaing, Ferrous Property Services, for the owner's lender file. Not a substitute for the Lease.\n1. Parties\nLandlord: Ironworks Yard Holdings LLC, a Virginia limited liability company (SCC ID S7041882), c/o Ferrous Property Services, 1700 Altamont Avenue, Suite 5, Richmond, VA 23230.\nTenant: Bao & Brine Dumpling House, Inc. (d/b/a \"Bao & Brine\"), FEIN 84-3317204.\nGuarantors: Quang Trinh and Mai-Ly Trinh, husband and wife, jointly and severally (Guaranty dated 09/22/2023, Exhibit D). Guarantor data per the credit application: Mr. Trinh, DOB 4/17/1979, SSN ending 8841; Mrs. Trinh, DOB 1981-12-02, SSN xxx-xx-0416; residence 9 Wythe Mews, Henrico, VA 23229.\n2. Premises\n3119 West Leigh Street, Unit B, Richmond, VA 23230 (in Scott's Addition), approx. 2,840 rentable sq. ft. on the ground floor plus a 310 sq. ft. patio licence. Tax parcel N000-1687/014.\n3. Term\nLease dated September 22, 2023. Commencement 11/01/2023; Rent Commencement February 1, 2024 (90-day abatement). Expiration 10/31/2033. Two 5-year options at 95% of FMV; notice no later than Jan. 31, 2033. The Lease is governed by Virginia law; Va. Code § 55.1-1200 et seq. does not apply to commercial premises.\n4. Base rent\nLease years\tAnnual\tMonthly\n1–2\t$79,520.00\t$6,626.67\n3–5\t$85,200.00\t$7,100.00\n6–10\t$93,720.00\t$7,810.00\n\nPercentage rent: 6% of gross sales over a natural breakpoint of $1,325,333 (years 1–2). CAM, taxes and insurance estimated at $5.85 psf, or $1,384.50/mo. Late charge 5% after the 5th; default interest 12% (Article 14).\n5. Security deposit\n$19,880 (three months), held in escrow account no. 2204 7718 03 at Shockoe Trust Bank (ABA 052646247), plus standby L/C no. SB-2023-00417 for $40,000, reducing to twenty thousand dollars after month 36.\n6. Use and exclusive\nFast-casual dumpling restaurant with beer and wine (ABC licence no. 088-417205). Landlord may not lease to another \"Asian dumpling or noodle concept\" in the Yard.\n7. Parking and loading\nFour reserved permits in Lot C (permit nos. IY-0211 to IY-0214), assigned to: VA plate UKR-4417 (Q. Trinh, grey Sienna); VA TZW 2291 (M. Trinh); VLD-8830 (the head chef, Anselmo); and the delivery van, VIN 1FTBR1C84PKA44172, plate pending. Loading dock 7–10 a.m. only.\n8. Insurance and notices\nCGL $1M per occurrence / $2M aggregate; liquor liability $1,000,000. Policy BOP-7718204-03, Tredegar Mutual Insurance Co.. Notices to Tenant at the Premises, with a copy to Imani Fairley, Esq., Fairley Legal PLC, ifairley@fairleylegal.example, 804-555-0138.\n9. Abstractor's flags\nThe Guaranty burns off after month 60 if there has been no default. Quang asked on 3/3/26 that Mai-Ly be released now because of their pending divorce. Referred to the owner.\nTenant was 45 days late on January rent; cured 2/14/2026 by cashier's check no. 0098417 for $7,455.00 including the late charge.\nRent is pulled by ACH from Tenant's operating account ending 5530. Mr. Trinh's cell is (804) 555-0177; quang@baoandbrine.example. Anselmo Rojas has the alarm code and opens most days.\n\nAbstract ID LA-2026-031 · D. Castaing", "kind": "Word document", "detail": "486 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Delphine Castaing", "Quang Trinh", "Mai-Ly Trinh", "Q. Trinh", "M. Trinh", "Anselmo", "Imani Fairley", "Quang", "Mai-Ly", "Mr. Trinh", "Anselmo Rojas"], "companies": ["Ironworks Yard Holdings LLC", "Ferrous Property Services", "Bao & Brine Dumpling House, Inc.", "Scott's Addition", "Shockoe Trust Bank", "Tredegar Mutual Insurance Co.", "Fairley Legal PLC", "Baoandbrine"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Richmond", "VA", "Scott's Addition", "Henryco", "Shockoe Trust Bank", "Lot C", "The Yard"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["Virginia", "married", "credit application", "divorce"], "names": ["Delphine", "Bao", "Quang", "Mai-Ly", "Anselmo", "Imani"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "label